 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School, identified by its own heading on line 10 ('Thomas C. Passios Elementary School Staff'). Lines 1-9 are the end of the principal's narrative (it mentions the Principal's Advisory Committee but lists no members) and line 40 is the page number ('1. 58 -'); all ignored. Lines 11, 15 and 21 are the section headings Administration, Primary and Specialists. Administration and Specialists print 'Title - Name', so the title is role_raw. Under Primary, lines 18 and 19 print only a dash and a name, continuing the Kindergarten line above; they are recorded with role_raw '' rather than assumed Kindergarten (Maureen DeFelice appears under Grade 1 in the 1992 roster). Lines 28-39 are two columns, Grade 1 | Grade 2 and then Grade 3 | Grade 4, with the grade label printed only on the first row of each column, so it goes in grade_or_dept. A cell printing 'A/B' (lines 24, 26) is two entries. Candy Prescott, Lori MacDougall and Nancy Rahaim are each printed twice on the page (a specialist role and a grade), and both printings are kept as printed."
